"The process sequence is controlled: pre-cleaning, drying, penetrant application, dwell, excess removal, drying where specified, developer application, development time, inspection and post-cleaning. Oil, oxide, paint, dirt or polishing debris can block an opening; excessive washing can remove penetrant from a fine crack; insufficient removal can create background that obscures indications.",
